 "explosions": {
  "_note": "Verbatim from the old build's visual-effects.json. `scale` multiplies the sprite's own frame size, exactly as Phaser's setScale did: the 32px explosion sheet at 0.1 draws 3.2 world units (= 3.2 grid cells) across. Do not modulate these by blast radius - the original did not, and doubling a module blast to 6.4 cells swamps the ship it happened on. `smoke` is the multiplier onto the 256px smoke sheet. The original used a flat 0.5 for everything, giving 12.8 cells per destroyed module; that reads fine when one module dies but this build's capital ships shed twenty in a second and the cloud buries the fight, so module smoke is pulled back to 0.125. A ship going down keeps the original 0.5 - it happens once.",
